Gatto's separate gatto-video-ffmpeg executable is
FFmpeg 9.0.2, built with x264 r3222 (b35605ace3ddf7c1a5d67a2eb553f034aef41d55),
SVT-AV1 4.2.0 and libaom 3.15.3 (b141d9c45db236335351c8a4b2a14b3ade27c937).
