into Gatto's Rust executable. Gatto's own source remains under its MIT license.
See the accompanying license and patent notices for the individual libraries.

Complete corresponding source and the build recipe accompany each release as
video-encoder-sources.tar.xz at https://github.com/jeremyc2/Gatto/releases.
For source builds: bun scripts/prepare-video-encoders.ts.
